{"level":30,"time":1756598273547,"pid":61473,"hostname":"tiloup","jobId":"775","sessionId":"1756343789180-f1fy2bw","msg":"This text illustrates an AI agent's conversational logic and interaction patterns. The agent consistently responds to user greetings with a friendly salutation and an offer of assistance. When faced with brief, ambiguous inputs like \"test,\" it acknowledges the input and seeks clarification on the user's intent. Internal thinking notes highlight the agent's rationale, focusing on polite engagement and readiness to assist. The agent also demonstrates a mechanism to detect and stop due to behavioral loops triggered by repeated, unclear inputs.\nPeux-tu analyser et m'expliquer ce fichier ? \nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 1)\nJe vais créer une todo list spécifique et utile pour organiser le travail demandé.\n\n\nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 3)\nThe user wants me to analyze and explain a file, but no file content or path was provided. I need to ask for more details.\n\nOui, je peux analyser un fichier. Quel fichier souhaitez-vous que j'analyse ? Pourriez-vous me fournir le chemin du fichier ou son contenu directement ?\nOui, je peux analyser un fichier. Quel fichier souhaitez-vous que j'analyse ? Pourriez-vous me fournir le chemin du fichier ou son contenu directement ?\nI will analyze the user's request, which is to analyze and explain a file, by first trying to read the file.\nI will mark the first todo as in_progress since I'm starting to analyze the request.\nI need to know which file the user wants me to analyze. Since the user just repeated the question without providing a file, I need to ask for the file.\n\n{\"thought\":\"The user has not provided a file path, so I need to ask for it to proceed with the analysis.\",\"command\":{\"name\":\"finish\",\"params\":{\"response\":\"Pour que je puisse analyser et expliquer le fichier, pourriez-vous me donner le chemin d'accès au fichier que vous souhaitez que j'examine ?\"}}}\n\nI will analyze the user's request, which is to analyze and explain a file, by first trying to read the file.\nI will mark the first todo as in_progress since I'm starting to analyze the request.\nI need to know which file the user wants me to analyze. Since the user just repeated the question without providing a file, I need to ask for the file.\n\n{\"thought\":\"The user has not provided a file path, so I need to ask for it to proceed with the analysis.\",\"command\":{\"name\":\"finish\",\"params\":{\"response\":\"Pour que je puisse analyser et expliquer le fichier, pourriez-vous me donner le chemin d'accès au fichier que vous souhaitez que j'examine ?\"}}}\n\nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 4)\ntest\nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 1)\nAn unexpected error occurred: LLM response appears repetitive, avoiding loop\nError in agent iteration: LLM response appears repetitive, avoiding loop\nTraitement de la réponse de l'utilisateur.\n\nI need to respond to the user's \"test\" input. Since it's a very brief and ambiguous input, I should acknowledge it and ask for clarification on what they would like me to do.Hello! You said \"test.\" Is there something specific you'd like me to test or help you with?\nI need to respond to the user's \"test\" input. Since it's a very brief and ambiguous input, I should acknowledge it and ask for clarification on what they would like me to do.Hello! You said \"test.\" Is there something specific you'd like me to test or help you with?\nhjgjhg\nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 1)\n\nHello! You provided \"hjgjhg\". Could you please tell me what you would like me to do or how I can assist you with that?\nHello! You provided \"hjgjhg\". Could you please tell me what you would like me to do or how I can assist you with that?\nkjkljlkj\nThe agent is thinking... (iteration 1)\nTraitement de la réponse de l'utilisateur.\n\nThe model did not return a valid response. Please try again or rephrase your request.\nThe model did not return a valid response. Please try again or rephrase your request."}
